<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 11	Dec 10	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  243.400     244.930     237.040    2.68 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.200     304.050     303.640    0.18 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.930     157.590     165.490   -4.57 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.658	46.596	48.410   -3.62 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  403.240     405.100     366.280   10.09 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.835     140.510     147.886   -4.77 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.978	16.005	14.975    6.70 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.940     216.170     230.135   -6.17 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.879	 1.874	 1.939   -3.09 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.566	 1.561	 1.575   -0.57 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.110     184.660     206.030  -10.15 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
